1154 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Congratulations on completing the acquisition of your company\056\n\nFrom this point forward\054 you are no longer responsible for any of the debts\054 liabilities\054 or creditor communication related to your previous company\056\n\nThis guide explains the step\055by\055step process to follow after your company \050\034Oldco\035\051 has been acquired\054 creating a new trading entity \050\034Newco\035\051\056\n\n\nFollowing this protocol will\072\n\nProtect your new business operations\nEnsure legal compliance\nSmoothly transition all matters from Oldco to Newco\n\n\nThe result\072\n\nYou do not need to speak to any creditor again\056 We are the only point of contact\n\nYou are free to focus entirely on your new company \050NewCo\051 \024 Clean\054 Compliant and Protected\056\n\n\n\nWe are here 24\0577\054 via WhatsApp and our legal support channels\054 \nto manage any issues that may arise\056\n\n\nPlease read through the manual carefully and follow the steps\056 If in doubt\054 just reach out to us \024 we\031re always one message away\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1155 0 R
     /Pg 1144 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

