1160 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Goals\072 Prevent Confusion\054 Protect Newco\031s assets\054 and demonstrate clear separation from Oldco\056\n\nSteps\072\n\nRemove Oldco Branding \023 take down all signs\054 logos\054 stationery\054 or materials with Oldco\031s name\056\050\nShowcase Newco \023 put up Newco signage at entrances\057reception\073 ensure lease\057licence is in Newco\031s name\056\050\nClearly display a notice confirming that \133OldCo Name\135\054 now renamed \133New Name\135\054 no longer operates from the premises\056 Direct all inquiries to the new address provided\056\050\nUpdate Utilities \046 Services \023 move bills\054 suppliers\054 and service accounts into Newco\031s name\056\050\nNotify Security\057Reception \023 confirm Oldco no longer operates at the premises\056\050\nWhy it matters\077\n\nUK law prevents bailiffs from seizing third\055party goods\056 Clear proof that assets belong to Newco avoids wrongful distraint\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1161 0 R
     /Pg 1144 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

